WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:12.810
That is the devil! Devilman! Devilman!

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.580
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:22.050
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:25.820
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:29.490
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:36.470
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:45.350
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:56.500
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.750 --> 00:01:00.700
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:04.360
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:11.480
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:20.380
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:35.090
HAKONE SUNLAND

00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:49.000
Blockhead.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.140
Dammit!

00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:02.960
Couples to the left, couples to right!
Couples everywhere!

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:06.930
I'm so lonesome...

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:20.900
I'm so lonesome, I'll take
the mountain road.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.580
It's overheated.

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:49.170
Humans are so cruel. Sometimes
it's hard to keep going--

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:53.980
It's a flower!

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:58.370
A flower on a pine tree?

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:00.680
Why would there be
a flower in a pine tree?

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:05.020
I'm not a biology teacher,
so it doesn’t matter!

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:24.380
DEMON WOODDOU
THE ENRAGED GREENERY

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:36.860
Police car! Police car!

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:44.560
I guess I was dreaming.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:04:01.110
The forest is gone!
I must still be dreaming!

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:05.910
So what's the point in waking up?

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:10.610
It really does hurt

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:15.610
Alphonne Louis Steinbeck III, a respected
teacher, does not know what is going on.

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:18.250
He is not the only one.

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:22.100
No one was aware of the
horrible developing situation.

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:38.040
An eerie, evil force
was creeping in the city.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:41.350
Even then, no one noticed...
not even Devilman.

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:51.760
- What's the matter?
- What strange flowers.

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:56.260
What about it?

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:58.430
Why would there be flowers
like that on a tree?

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:00.270
They must be fake.
Who cares?

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:06.610
In truth, it was of no concern just
then to Devilman, a.k.a. Akira Fudo.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:09.340
In a shod period of peace and rest,

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:12.440
Devilman's sharp wits were dulling.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:30.230
- Huh?
- Somethings wrong.

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:36.430
I see now! The tree that's
always been over there is gone!

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:42.670
When was it cut down?

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:47.710
It wasn't cut down.
It was pulled by the roots.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.210
Tare!

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:55.210
He faints a lot.

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:58.550
It's because his eyes are too big.

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:00.210
Tare! Wake up!

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:03.030
Wake up! Hey, wake up!

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:08.490
Th-They... They've gone crazy!

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:09.470
Who has?

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:11.960
They've gone crazy, I said!

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:15.010
We know they've gone crazy,
but who are "they"?

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:19.300
The trees! The trees in
the yard started walking!

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:21.980
Tare, I think you're the
one who's gone crazy.

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:28.540
Tare was right!

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:30.310
See, I was telling the truth!

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:34.720
It's because humans have
mistreated the trees and plants!

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:37.420
They've started a revolution!

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:10.340
Hey, there goes our tree!

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:14.080
Papa will be so disappointed.
He was awfully proud of it.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:15.490
How sad.

00:09:16.050 --> 00:09:21.090
How could they start moving?
Akira, do you know?

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:23.430
Then again, how would you know?

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:26.290
I wonder if they're being
possessed by demons.

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.530
But no, there are too many of them.

00:09:28.530 --> 00:09:31.440
It's almost like
someone's controlling them.

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:46.650
- Look! The flowers we saw before!
- The ones from the tree!

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:48.620
We have those in our garden, too!

00:09:48.620 --> 00:09:49.720
What?

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:11.310
- It started walking!
- Run!

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:18.880
Help! They're coming from here, too!

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:29.860
Akira, we can't escape!

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:32.600
Tare!

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.100
Akira!

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:37.600
Miki!

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:40.870
Dammit, they're after us!

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.940
They're from the Demon Tribe after all.

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:48.710
My cherished Demon Wooddou!
Destroy the foolish humans!

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:52.150
Even Devilman is not worth fearing.

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:57.650
As long as he does not find you, he
will simply fight himself and lose!

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:06.030
Akira!

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:07.760
Miki!

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:09.970
Akira!

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:14.470
Miki!

00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:31.460
Damn you!

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:34.090
Dammit, here it goes...

00:11:34.090 --> 00:11:37.330
DEVIL!

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:41.900
D-D-Devil?!

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:47.380
I'm so shocked,
I can't even wet myself!

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:53.880
Oh no, Tare saw me...

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:02.190
Devil Wing!

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:07.830
Devil Cutter!

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:17.230
I have nothing left to wet my pants with!

00:12:17.230 --> 00:12:20.810
Watch out!
Devil Beam!

00:12:30.380 --> 00:12:32.760
Devil Arrow!

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:42.260
Devil Beam!

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:43.830
Devil Arrow!

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:47.160
At last, my true identity
has been uncovered.

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:51.030
Now I have to tell him everything...

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:53.740
Since I will never see Miki again.

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:01.150
H-H-H-H-Help me!

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:07.560
Don't be afraid, just
listen to what I have to say!

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:17.190
Damn, there's still some left!

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:21.000
Devil Arrow!

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:32.770
They're infinite!
That damn Xenon!

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:35.050
Did he recruit all
the Demon Tribe for this?

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:43.920
First of all, I have to take
these two somewhere safe.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:47.260
It's almost like
someone's controlling them.

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:50.040
That's it! Could it be...

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:56.870
If Miki's right, these insane trees
aren't actual demons.

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:08.710
There must be a hidden
demon controlling them.

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:17.050
There is something fishy around here.

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:18.790
Devil Eye!

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:23.130
Show yourself, Demon Tribe!

00:14:26.390 --> 00:14:29.670
That's right, I need to put
these two somewhere safe.

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:34.840
This should be fine.
Please just wait here for now.

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:50.050
Sis, we've fallen down into Hell!

00:14:50.050 --> 00:14:54.860
We have to escape!
Sis, this is no time for a nap!

00:14:58.590 --> 00:15:00.600
The flowers again!

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:04.240
This has to be Hell!

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:21.820
I've finally found you, Demon Wooddou!

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:25.760
You were controlling the trees from
under the highway, weren't you?

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:30.100
Just you watch!

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:35.300
They're in danger!

00:15:48.140 --> 00:15:50.240
You finally noticed, Devilman.

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:52.850
My evil powers will change this world
into a garden of demons.

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:57.450
I shall eat this world up like an
insect underneath the skin of a fruit.

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:59.690
I am the one controlling the trees!

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:02.290
Devil Chop!

00:16:04.460 --> 00:16:05.800
Devil Kick!

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:08.470
Devil Cutter!

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:12.000
Th-That's enough!

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:16.150
I won't let you escape!

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:32.230
Unhand me, Devilman!

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:40.090
So that's it, Wooddou you bastard!

00:16:40.090 --> 00:16:42.570
Wooddou's in pain because
I've got him by his feeler!

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:51.410
Suffer! Suffer until you die!

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:17.030
Fool! This is your punishment
for opposing the mighty Wooddou!

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:21.370
Damn, if only I could
move my left hand...

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:27.310
l sot it!

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:29.220
Devil Cutter!

00:17:33.810 --> 00:17:36.490
Devil Beam!

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:25.810
Tare saw me. I have no choice
but to leave, Miki.

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:40.760
May happiness be yours, Miki.

00:18:57.470 --> 00:18:59.380
Farewell, Miki.

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:03.710
Hey!

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:07.940
I saw! I saw!
I'm going to tell everyone!

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:09.810
Tare, when did you wake up?

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:12.480
Haha, just now!

00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:14.580
Why are we in the graveyard?

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:17.750
Ah, whatever.
All the monsters are gone.

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:20.090
I had the weirdest dream.

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:21.490
A dream?

00:19:21.490 --> 00:19:23.690
Yeah, you were...

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:25.030
Don't laugh, okay?

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:28.470
You shouted "DEVIL!" and transformed!

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:34.710
Then you became Devilman and
beat the snot out of 'em!

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:40.740
I know it was weird,
but don't be mad, okay?

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:44.310
I won't be mad at you!
It sounds like a cool dream!

00:19:50.280 --> 00:19:51.550
Akira!

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:53.450
Hey, you're awake.

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:54.790
Well, aren't you nice?

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:57.620
Instead of looking after
me, you sit there laughing!

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.870
My bad!

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:04.730
How can I not laugh?
Me, turn into Devilman?

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:06.870
That's exactly the kind
of dream Tare would have.

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:17.310
There's no point in
trying to help me now!

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:18.920
Put me down! Put me down!

00:20:19.550 --> 00:20:22.620
Even with what had happened,
Akira did not notice that

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:25.490
Demon Lord Xenon is finally
pulling out his trump card

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:28.930
to destroy Devilman
and the human race...

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:49.770
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:56.480
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.320 --> 00:21:04.130
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:09.980
Who Devilman really is

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:13.930
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:13.930 --> 00:21:17.140
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.140 --> 00:21:22.140
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:32.990
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:53.020
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:53.970 --> 00:21:59.220
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:04.710
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:06.850 --> 00:22:11.850
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:16.600
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:19.600
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:26.280
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:36.420
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.910
The ultimate vacuum of the black hole is
said to lie in the far reaches of space.

00:23:04.540 --> 00:23:07.950
The Demon Dremoon possesses
that mysterious power.

00:23:07.950 --> 00:23:11.020
He is attempting to destroy
the beautiful planet Earth.

00:23:20.390 --> 00:23:22.700
SUBWAY

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:31.580
How can there be a flood,
when we didn't get a typhoon?

00:23:36.080 --> 00:23:38.680
Hey Tare, this is from your mother.

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:40.920
Thank you!

00:23:42.550 --> 00:23:45.250
Hey, do you know
what caused this flood?

00:23:45.250 --> 00:23:47.700
I guess it's because you
always wet yourself.

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:51.320
N-No way, not even I could...

00:23:51.320 --> 00:23:52.670
Don't insult me!

00:24:02.570 --> 00:24:04.110
A satellite!

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:08.280
Dremoon! Damn!

00:24:14.310 --> 00:24:15.980
Devilman!

00:24:15.980 --> 00:24:20.290
Hiding behind a satellite in
lunar orbit? Clever, Dremoon!

00:24:20.290 --> 00:24:23.960
I am impressed that you saw through it,
Devilman! But this is the end!

00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:26.770
Dremoon!

00:24:32.270 --> 00:24:37.270
Deadly action takes place with
the moon as the battleground!

00:24:37.800 --> 00:24:39.200
Next time on Devilman:

00:24:39.210 --> 00:24:41.780
DEMON DREMOON
THE MOON IS HELL

00:24:42.610 --> 00:24:45.610
Tune in next time and
see Devilman in action!
